  "releaseNotes": "1.2026.7.1: Initial release.\n- Staging and GUID mapping table DDL from Dataverse metadata (drop-and-recreate or create-if-missing)\n- Strict one-dependency-tier-per-file batching for SSIS package sequencing; cycles broken by edge-dropping with deferred-update warnings\n- Solution-based table and column filtering; per-environment remembered selections\n- Configurable table prefixes and match-key suffixes; dependency-ranking exclusions\n- Extra outputs: truncate script, teardown script, styled Excel data dictionary, Mermaid dependency diagram\n- Guarded match-key indexes; session metadata cache; cancelable generation",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Scaffold SQL staging and GUID mapping tables from Dataverse metadata, batched by dependency tier - plus data dictionary, dependency diagram, and harness reset/teardown scripts.",
